msgid "Delete shapes that lose all of their triangles"
msgstr "Eliminar formas que pierdan todos sus triángulos"

#: res/xrc/Automation.xrc:3646
msgid "Uncheck to leave such shapes untouched instead."
msgstr "Desmarca para dejar esas formas sin tocar en su lugar."

